OL,3,GNEWSARare Titanic ticket expected to
OL,4,Afetch #50,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare ticket allowing visitors to
OL,7,Fwatch the Titanic depart on its maiden
OL,8,Fvoyage is going up for auction.
OL,10,FThe pass belonged to Eliza Dibden whose
OL,11,F18-year-old son boarded the doomed
OL,12,Fliner but never returned home. She was
OL,13,Famong those watching the ship leave
OL,14,FSouthampton on 10 April 1912, as her
OL,15,Fson William set off on his journey.
OL,17,FAndrew Aldridge, of auctioneers Henry
OL,18,FAldridge and Son Ltd, said: "This is
OL,19,Fthe only ticket of this type that has
OL,20,Fever been offered for auction."
